[ 2026-09-05 15:34:35,987 ] trafilatura.main_extractor - DEBUG - extra in p: p For all of us working on computational and machine learning methods in science, systems like AlphaFold demonstrate the stunning potential for AI as a tool to aid fundamental discovery. Just as 50 years ago Anfinsen laid out a challenge far beyond scienceâs reach at the time, there are many aspects of our universe that remain unknown. The progress announced today gives us further confidence that AI will become one of humanityâs most useful tools in expanding the frontiers of scientific knowledge, and weâre looking forward to the many years of hard work and discovery ahead!
